---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Terms of Service">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1 class="page-title">
        <span class="text-white">Official</span> <span class="text-gold">Nugzz Crew</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="page-kicker">Terms of Service</p>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mt-2">Last updated: November 1, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          By accessing or using officialnugzzcrew.com (“the Site”) and any related tools or features, you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not use the Site. These Terms apply to all visitors, including those who create an account via Discord or Google/YouTube sign-in.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          Official Nugzz Crew provides community resources, tools, and information focused on GTA Online, including glitch methods, DMO-related content, custom generators, emblem tools, maps, and related community features. Optional account sign-in enables account linking for DMO ticket integration and live stream command features.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">3. Accounts & Sign-In</h2>
        <div class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base space-y-3">
          <p>You may optionally sign in using Discord or Google/YouTube OAuth. By doing so, you authorize us to receive the basic profile information described in our <a href="/privacy" class="text-gold hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
          <p>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your Discord and Google accounts. You must not share access or allow others to use your linked account on the Site.</p>
          <p>We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms or engage in abuse.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">4. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base mb-2">You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-2">
          <li>Use the Site or tools for any illegal purpose</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or gain unauthorized access to the Site or related systems</li>
          <li>Harass, threaten, or abuse other community members</li>
          <li>Upload or distribute malware or harmful content</li>
          <li>Misrepresent your identity or affiliation</li>
          <li>Scrape or systematically extract data in a way that harms the Site</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base mt-3">
          Content related to GTA Online methods is provided for informational and educational purposes within the community. Users are solely responsible for their own actions in-game and any consequences that may result from Rockstar Games or other platforms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          All original content, tools, branding, and design on the Site are owned by Official Nugzz Crew unless otherwise noted. You may not copy, reproduce, or redistribute Site materials for commercial purposes without permission. Third-party trademarks (including Rockstar, GTA, Discord, Google, YouTube) remain the property of their respective owners.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">6. Disclaimers</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          The Site and all tools are provided “as is” and “as available” without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee that tools will be free of errors, that methods will remain functional, or that use of any information will not result in account actions by game platforms. Use of glitch-related content is at your own risk.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Official Nugzz Crew shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the Site, tools, or linked account features.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">8. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          We may update these Terms at any time. The updated version will be posted on this page with a new “Last updated” date. Continued use of the Site constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">9. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          Questions about these Terms? Contact us at:<br>
          <a href="mailto:nugzzcrew@gmail.com" class="text-gold hover:underline font-medium">nugzzcrew@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs mt-4">
          Official Nugzz Crew • officialnugzzcrew.com • Built for The Fam Bam
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>